# "Sync now" with a non-empty offline queue flushes it FIRST (--push-pending), then mirrors.
desc app menu: Sync now with pending queue -> --push-pending then --mirror-catalog
invoke app
config paired
wifi up
pending Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
engine 0|RESULT pushed=1
engine 0|MIRROR created=0 updated=0\nRESULT ok
pick 0
pick 255
expect_exit 0
expect_trace ENGINE --push-pending
expect_trace ENGINE --mirror-catalog
expect_trace PANEL mode=auto title='Sync complete'
